msgid "Nexus 平台图册"
msgstr "Nexus platform diagram atlas"

msgid ""
"本图册交付15类必需视图及两张补充图。主图登记见 {download}`图清单 <diagram-index.csv>`，维护规则见 "
"[图示标准](../../design/documentation-standards.md)。图有精确current/reference身份， "
"不可从图源存在、渲染成功或软件流程推断硬件和外部发布已执行。"
msgstr ""
"This atlas delivers 15 required views and two supplementary diagrams. Main "
"views are registered in {download}`the diagram index <diagram-index.csv>`; "
"maintenance follows the [diagram standards](../../design/documentation-"
"standards.md). Each view has an exact current/reference identity. Source "
"existence, successful rendering or a software flow does not prove hardware "
"execution or external publication."

msgid ""
"代码依据固定为`0111c8d3b9c7b37d258b9c401070305b13b6f3a1`，该提交后的本轮 "
"文档工具实现另以最终执行记录为准；固件源码关系没有随图生成改变。图源为可编辑 "
"DOT，输出为本地SVG。深色标签、线型和文字共同表达关系，不依赖颜色单独传达。"
msgstr ""
"Code references are pinned to `0111c8d3b9c7b37d258b9c401070305b13b6f3a1`; "
"documentation tooling implemented after that commit is bounded by its final "
"execution records. Rendering did not change firmware source relationships. "
"Editable DOT sources produce local SVG. Dark labels, line styles and text "
"jointly express relationships rather than depending on color alone."

msgid ""
"17个图源各派生中文与英文视图，页面按所选语言使用本地SVG。节点、箭头、属性与 范围仍由同一canonical "
"DOT维护；`labels.json`只维护完整标签译文，不能改变拓扑。 "
"34组语言DOT/SVG与原图配对检查；缺失译文、陈旧输出和非法资源使门禁失败。 SVG采用Graphviz "
"Cairo字形路径输出，使离线读者无需安装中文字体；每图附title、 "
"desc和正文alt/caption。生成主机需要锁定Graphviz、Cairo及Noto Sans CJK SC， "
"最终工具身份与自动检查结果由文档交付记录绑定。源码语义、实际浏览器桌面/窄屏/ "
"放大/打印与离线包验收分开记录。15主图和2补充图已独立逐边与PNG审查；current为source_reviewed，reference为 "
"reference_reviewed，补充target为design_reviewed。浏览器与正式包验收另按实际 "
"执行记录判断，这些状态不建立HIL或公开部署资格。"
msgstr ""
"Each of the 17 sources derives Chinese and English views; pages use the "
"local SVG for their selected language. One canonical DOT still owns nodes, "
"edges, attributes and scope; `labels.json` contains complete label "
"translations only and cannot change topology. Checks pair all 34 localized "
"DOT/SVG sets with their originals; missing translations, stale output or "
"illegal resources fail the gate. Graphviz Cairo emits SVG glyph paths so "
"offline readers need no Chinese fonts. Each view includes a title, "
"description and textual alt/caption. The generation host requires locked "
"Graphviz, Cairo and Noto Sans CJK SC; delivery records bind final tool "
"identities and automated results. Source semantics, actual desktop/narrow-"
"screen/zoom/print browser checks and offline acceptance have separate "
"records. The 15 main and two supplementary sources have independent edge-by-"
"edge and PNG review: current is source_reviewed, reference is "
"reference_reviewed, and the supplementary target is design_reviewed. Actual "
"records establish browser and formal-package acceptance separately; these "
"states establish neither HIL nor public-deployment qualification."

msgid "修改标签后显式使用已准备的锁定工具生成语言视图，然后执行完整检查："
msgstr ""
"After changing labels, explicitly use the prepared locked tools to generate "
"language views, then run the complete check:"

msgid ""
"`localized/en/`和`localized/zh_CN/`是派生资产。生成成功只证明渲染；标签语义、 "
"真实浏览器和离线资源闭包分别审查，原图代码依据与历史执行身份保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"`localized/en/` and `localized/zh_CN/` are derived assets. Successful "
"generation proves rendering only. Label semantics, actual browser behavior "
"and offline resource closure are reviewed separately; original diagram code "
"references and historical execution identities remain unchanged."

msgid "FIG-01 全平台分层与外部边界"
msgstr "FIG-01 Whole-platform layers and external boundaries"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：产品外置；可选组件与OS；运行访问和构建事实逐边区分。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: current. Scope: Products remain external; components and OS are "
"optional; runtime access and build facts have distinct edges.**"

msgid "![FIG-01：产品外置；可选组件与OS；运行访问和构建事实逐边区分](platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-01: Products remain external; components and OS are optional; runtime "
"access and build facts have distinct edges.](platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "FIG-01：产品外置；可选组件与OS；运行访问和构建事实逐边区分"
msgstr ""
"FIG-01: Products remain external; components and OS are optional; runtime "
"access and build facts have distinct edges."

msgid ""
"应用拥有任务、调度、恢复和停机协调。Board参与构建期授权；factory取得身份后日常I/O通过face进入provider。Arch按编译目标选择，没有CPU"
" factory或强制OS转发。虚线为显式可选关系或构建期事实，实线标签说明调用/合同。"
msgstr ""
"Applications own tasks, scheduling, recovery and shutdown coordination. "
"Board contributes build-time authorization. After factory lookup obtains an "
"identity, daily I/O enters the provider through its face. Arch is selected "
"by the compiled target; there is no CPU factory or mandatory OS forwarding. "
"Dashed edges denote explicit optional relationships or build-time facts; "
"solid edge labels identify calls/contracts."

