msgid "FIG-03：构建输入/产物链，生成失败使owned bundle失效"
msgstr ""
"FIG-03: Build-input/artifact chain; generation failure invalidates the owned"
" bundle."

msgid ""
"边表示构建时输入和产物传递，不表示运行时调用。严格解析不能修复非法字段、冲突或陈旧输入；失败只撤回拥有的输出，不清理未拥有目录，也不暴露半成品。ELF/资源报告不构成实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"Edges represent build-time input and artifact flow, not runtime calls. "
"Strict parsing cannot repair invalid fields, conflicts or stale inputs. "
"Failure withdraws only owned outputs: it neither clears unowned directories "
"nor exposes partial artifacts. ELF/resource reports do not establish "
"physical-board qualification."

