msgid "FIG-04 factory与静态实例"
msgstr "FIG-04 Factory and static instances"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：按需选入的两同类实例示意；同模式ops共享，controller/endpoint独立。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: reference. Scope: Illustrative two selected instances of one "
"class; same-mode ops are shared; controller/endpoint identities remain "
"separate.**"

msgid ""
"![FIG-04：按需选入的两同类实例示意；同模式ops共享，controller/endpoint独立](factory-instances.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-04: Illustrative two selected instances of one class; same-mode ops "
"are shared; controller/endpoint identities remain separate.](factory-"
"instances.svg)"

msgid "FIG-04：按需选入的两同类实例示意；同模式ops共享，controller/endpoint独立"
msgstr ""
"FIG-04: Illustrative two selected instances of one class; same-mode ops are "
"shared; controller/endpoint identities remain separate."

msgid ""
"结构图展示由生成器支持的按配置实例布局，不声称每块PCB均授权这些组合。同provider同模式实例共享readonly "
"ops，各自context/state/storage独立。不同provider或模式可使用不同ops；调用方法接收本次context。controller和endpoint有独立factory命名空间，endpoint不冒充控制器。ID只在当前assembly有效，默认uint16_t"
" typedef不提供语言级跨类防混用。"
msgstr ""
"The structure shows configuration-selected layouts supported by the "
"generator; it does not claim every PCB authorizes those combinations. Same-"
"provider, same-mode instances share read-only ops while each "
"context/state/storage remains independent. Different providers or modes can "
"have different ops; a method receives the current context. Controllers and "
"endpoints have distinct factory namespaces, and an endpoint cannot "
"impersonate its controller. IDs are valid only in the current assembly; the "
"default uint16_t typedef does not provide language-level protection against "
"mixing classes."

