msgid "FIG-05 显式启动停机与失败撤回"
msgstr "FIG-05 Explicit start, stop and failure cleanup"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：生成生命周期骨架；每个SoC私有启动/清理保持具体合同。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: current. Scope: Generated lifecycle skeleton; each SoC retains "
"its own private startup/cleanup contract.**"

msgid "![FIG-05：生成生命周期骨架；每个SoC私有启动/清理保持具体合同](platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-05: Generated lifecycle skeleton; each SoC retains its own private "
"startup/cleanup contract.](platform-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-05：生成生命周期骨架；每个SoC私有启动/清理保持具体合同"
msgstr ""
"FIG-05: Generated lifecycle skeleton; each SoC retains its own private "
"startup/cleanup contract."

msgid ""
"外部唯一执行者串行调用start/stop。start不启动调度器；失败的primary、cleanup、remaining_effects分别保留。已取得效果者参与逆序cleanup，停止可能先成功释放部分实例再返回BUSY/IO。不能把BUSY视为仍然完整运行，也不能因timeout回收存储。具体start_system失败可能在其私有路径中完成清理或保留失败阶段，重试必须满足该provider合同，不能把图视为统一恢复API。"
msgstr ""
"One external executor serializes start/stop. start does not start a "
"scheduler; failures retain primary, cleanup and remaining_effects "
"separately. Owners of acquired effects participate in reverse-order cleanup."
" Stop can release some instances successfully before returning BUSY/IO. BUSY"
" cannot imply the platform is still fully running, and timeout does not "
"permit storage reclamation. A concrete start_system failure may clean up "
"inside its private path or retain the failed phase. Retry must satisfy that "
"provider contract; the diagram is not a universal recovery API."

msgid ""
"依据：[生成的start/stop](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py)、[GPIO冷租约](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/gpio_phase.py)、[H743冷生命周期](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)、[当前平台合同](../../delivery/architecture.md)。 "
"{download}`可编辑DOT <platform-lifecycle.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-47。"
msgstr ""
"Sources: [generated start/stop](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py), "
"[cold GPIO lease](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/gpio_phase.py), [H743 cold "
"lifecycle](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md), [current platform "
"contract](../../delivery/architecture.md).  {download}`editable DOT "
"<platform-lifecycle.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-47."

msgid "FIG-06 Core请求状态与借用"
msgstr "FIG-06 Core request states and borrows"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：Core helper允许的迁移与调用前提；不承诺各provider恢复API。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: current. Scope: Transitions and preconditions allowed by Core "
"helpers; no promise of a recovery API for every provider.**"

msgid ""
"![FIG-06：Core helper允许的迁移与调用前提；不承诺各provider恢复API](request-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-06: Transitions and preconditions allowed by Core helpers; no promise "
"of a recovery API for every provider.](request-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-06：Core helper允许的迁移与调用前提；不承诺各provider恢复API"
msgstr ""
"FIG-06: Transitions and preconditions allowed by Core helpers; no promise of"
" a recovery API for every provider."

msgid ""
"REJECTED/ACCEPTED是admission结果而非request状态。ACCEPTED后保持request/buffer借用，cancel/deadline只启动终止进度。provider先排空全部必要引用，再以release发布SETTLED作为对request的最后一次访问；调用方以acquire观察。相关adapter/observer另需退出。QUARANTINED到SETTLED仅在实际恢复和排空证明成立时合法，不能通过initialize强行重置借用对象。"
msgstr ""
"REJECTED/ACCEPTED are admission results, not request states. After ACCEPTED,"
" request/buffer borrowing continues; cancel/deadline only starts termination"
" progress. The provider first drains every required reference, then release-"
"publishes SETTLED as its final request access; the caller observes with "
"acquire semantics. Related adapters/observers must exit separately. "
"QUARANTINED to SETTLED is legal only after actual recovery and proof of "
"drain. initialize cannot forcibly reset a borrowed object."

