msgid "FIG-08 wait wake与外部退出"
msgstr "FIG-08 Wait, wake and externally owned shutdown"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready与实际执行/join责任。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: current. Scope: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready and actual "
"execution/join responsibilities.**"

msgid ""
"![FIG-08：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready与实际执行/join责任](wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-08: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready and actual execution/join "
"responsibilities.](wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

msgid "FIG-08：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready与实际执行/join责任"
msgstr ""
"FIG-08: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready and actual execution/join "
"responsibilities."

msgid ""
"nx_wait_until只检查谓词并等待提示，不service硬件或创建worker。arm后再次检查避免lost "
"wake；TIMEOUT后最终谓词为true仍返回SUCCESS。通知端口要求单一waiter。外部shutdown先关闭admission并请求cancel，保持owner/IRQ推进drain。producer借用结清后join；确认owner"
" idle包含publication退出，再结束并join执行者。随后停止硬件RX/IRQ publishers、detach "
"wake并join其他发布者，最后销毁OS同步存储。相关observers最终访问另需退出；仍运行的内核不得提前撤回clock/Tick，失败存储继续保留。"
msgstr ""
"nx_wait_until only checks a predicate and waits for hints; it neither "
"services hardware nor creates a worker. Rechecking after arm prevents a lost"
" wake. After TIMEOUT, a final true predicate still returns SUCCESS. The "
"notification port requires one waiter. External shutdown first closes "
"admission and requests cancel while keeping owner/IRQ drain progress alive. "
"Join producers after their loans settle; confirm owner idle includes "
"publication exit, then stop and join the executor. Next stop hardware RX/IRQ"
" publishers, detach wake and join other publishers; only then destroy OS "
"synchronization storage. Related observers need their final access to exit "
"independently. A running kernel must retain its clock/Tick, and failed "
"storage remains retained."

