"SOURCE/os/include/nexus/os/wait.h)、[生产wait算法](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/wait.c)、[owner接口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/bus_owner.h)、[OS生命周期](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/README.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT "
"<wait-wake-shutdown.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-50。"
msgstr ""
"Sources: [wait contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/include/nexus/os/wait.h), [production wait "
"algorithm](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
