"Implementation item: DOC-50."

msgid "FIG-09 H743内存DMA与Cache"
msgstr "FIG-09 H743 memory, DMA and cache"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：H743ZIT6有限USART3 TX；AXI SRAM完整32-byte lines。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: reference. Scope: Finite H743ZIT6 USART3 TX; complete 32-byte "
"AXI SRAM lines.**"

msgid ""
"![FIG-09：H743ZIT6有限USART3 TX；AXI SRAM完整32-byte lines](h743-memory-cache.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-09: Finite H743ZIT6 USART3 TX; complete 32-byte AXI SRAM "
"lines.](h743-memory-cache.svg)"

msgid "FIG-09：H743ZIT6有限USART3 TX；AXI SRAM完整32-byte lines"
msgstr "FIG-09: Finite H743ZIT6 USART3 TX; complete 32-byte AXI SRAM lines."

msgid ""
"选定TX DMA仅授权AXI SRAM 512 KiB；其他物理域和dma_engines可达事实不自动授权placement或供电。Cache-"
"on要求完整32-byte lines独占，最大65504 bytes；Cache-off接受1..65535 "
"bytes。PREPARING借用先成立，clean在调用方正常mask下进行，完成前不能取消回收。图不实现或声明H743 RX "
"DMA；未来RX需要独立前置及排空后维护合同。可信复位或此前成功自有clean/disable才建立冷cache前提，CCR关闭位不能认领外国dirty状态。"
msgstr ""
"Selected TX DMA authorizes only 512 KiB AXI SRAM; other physical domains and"
" dma_engines reachability facts do not automatically authorize placement or "
"power. Cache-on requires exclusive complete 32-byte lines, with a maximum of"
" 65504 bytes; Cache-off accepts 1..65535 bytes. PREPARING establishes the "
"borrow first; clean executes under the caller’s normal masks, and "
"cancellation cannot reclaim storage before it finishes. This diagram neither"
" implements nor claims H743 RX DMA; future RX needs separate pre- and post-"
"drain maintenance contracts. Trusted reset or a prior successful owned "
"clean/disable establishes cold caches; clear CCR bits cannot claim "
"responsibility for foreign dirty state."

