"SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/cache.h)、[冷cache合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/cache_control.h)。 {download}`可编辑DOT "
"<h743-memory-cache.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-51。"
msgstr ""
