msgid "FIG-14 U575同步双域参考"
msgstr "FIG-14 U575 synchronous dual-domain reference"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：独立TZEN1无OS同步GPIO；不改变TZEN0默认provider。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: reference. Scope: Independent TZEN1 synchronous GPIO without OS;"
" the default TZEN0 provider is unchanged.**"

msgid ""
"![FIG-14：独立TZEN1无OS同步GPIO；不改变TZEN0默认provider](u575-security-domains.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-14: Independent TZEN1 synchronous GPIO without OS; the default TZEN0 "
"provider is unchanged.](u575-security-domains.svg)"

msgid "FIG-14：独立TZEN1无OS同步GPIO；不改变TZEN0默认provider"
msgstr ""
"FIG-14: Independent TZEN1 synchronous GPIO without OS; the default TZEN0 "
"provider is unchanged."

msgid ""
"boot owner供给并在执行前建立实际option-byte/镜像布局前提，机制不写option bytes。GTZC/SAU/NS "
"MPU是不同边界，NSC fetch检查Secure MPU，不能用CMSE观察替代bus firewall或pin。参考要求无NS "
"handlers、RTOS和自主masters，固定world principal只允许同步scalar "
"GPIO。取得不可逆效果后的失败只能保留到reset；SG的同步pin来自静态映射和无并发条件。实际8/16 MPU "
"region观测仅属于此参考，不修改TZEN0 provider的exact-eight tuple。全部物理隔离尚未执行。"
msgstr ""
"The boot owner supplies and establishes actual option-byte/image-layout "
"preconditions before execution; the mechanism does not write option bytes. "
"GTZC, SAU and NS MPU are distinct boundaries. NSC fetch checks Secure MPU; "
"CMSE observation cannot replace a bus firewall or pinning. This reference "
"requires no NS handlers, RTOS or autonomous masters; its fixed world "
"principal permits only synchronous scalar GPIO. Failure after acquiring "
"irreversible effects must be retained until reset. Synchronous SG pinning "
"derives from static mappings and absence of concurrency. Actual observations"
" of 8/16 MPU regions apply only to this reference and do not alter the "
"exact-eight tuple of the TZEN0 provider. All physical isolation cases remain"
" unexecuted."

