msgid "FIG-15 连续RX与可见丢块"
msgstr "FIG-15 Continuous RX and observable block loss"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：F407 USART1连续RX；预置FIFO贷款、loss和停止责任。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: reference. Scope: Continuous F407 USART1 RX; preposted FIFO "
"loans, loss and stop responsibilities.**"

msgid "![FIG-15：F407 USART1连续RX；预置FIFO贷款、loss和停止责任](continuous-stream.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-15: Continuous F407 USART1 RX; preposted FIFO loans, loss and stop "
"responsibilities.](continuous-stream.svg)"

msgid "FIG-15：F407 USART1连续RX；预置FIFO贷款、loss和停止责任"
msgstr ""
"FIG-15: Continuous F407 USART1 RX; preposted FIFO loans, loss and stop "
"responsibilities."

msgid ""
"preposted producer和普通producer不得混用。旧块在两个hardware "
"targets中完全消失并证明CT/EN/新flags后才能FIFO发布；失败撤源并LIFO撤未来贷款，BORROWED "
"consumer块不被覆盖。缺spare、IDLE和恢复可有间隙，lost_blocks是已观察边界而非精确遗漏wire字节。TC标志不能数任意多次合并回绕，实际IRQ/换址延迟必须小于一块fill时间。stop关闭admission、保持drain，outstanding=0后仍需调用者/observer退出。ADC首发trigger"
" blocks由service显式rearm且有块间间隙，本图不声称连续ADC。"
msgstr ""
"Do not mix preposted and ordinary producers. Publish an old block in FIFO "
"order only after it disappears completely from both hardware targets and "
"CT/EN/new flags prove withdrawal. On failure, withdraw sources and release "
"future loans in LIFO order; BORROWED consumer blocks must not be "
"overwritten. Missing spare blocks, IDLE and recovery can cause gaps. "
"lost_blocks counts observed boundaries, not exact missing wire bytes. A TC "
"flag cannot count arbitrary coalesced wraps; actual IRQ/address-replacement "
"latency must be shorter than one block fill time. stop closes admission and "
"preserves drain. outstanding=0 still requires caller/observer exit. First-"
"release ADC trigger blocks are explicitly rearmed by service and have gaps "
"between blocks; this view does not claim continuous ADC."

